#: scenario7:scenario7_992E7B91_DD8C_4CFF_BE91_EDCFE80267E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 633d33e7913ccad79087fe879af6b7dcddac331baeb42df3eb9af5d19d2048e8
