msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I can hear you just fine, my dear.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Now, what brings you all the way "
"up here?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Eu posso te ouvir muito bem, meu querido.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Agora, o que te traz até "
"aqui em cima?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_871311D2_CE60_4D24_BA59_92D10EF42D9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 235587ba92b66bde777d390f5a13a8ed03e26e4d5e4fcfdb8ead4dc24e70005f
#. default-sha256: ce54fc9f7f2898f440c310ebf6a00ab4cafce01c4086a2fa5d4271086392a7c6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_871311D2_CE60_4D24_BA59_92D10EF42D9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You know you can call me from anywhere in the house.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My bonds to this tower have "
"been broken."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você sabe que pode me chamar de qualquer lugar da casa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Meus laços com esta torre "
"foram quebrados."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E05ECFDB_24A1_463F_AB5C_00E1A7656DB3
