msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And now you wish to be rid of me,⟪k:3⟫so you can complete your descent into the "
"realm of the unclean?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E agora você quer se livrar de mim,⟪k:3⟫para que possa completar sua descida ao "
"reino do imundo?"

