#: scenario7:scenario7_EBF8C076_5FC9_4BA2_A55A_73FC3D5FB75E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d230268ee6f9e41bb460323209451314dbfe340a2045f38c2e0ec5d3205ac5a
