msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m sorry, Michel, but we are kindred spirits—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫as much as you may "
"want to deny it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sinto muito, Michel, mas somos almas semelhantes—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫por mais que você "
"queira negar."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D560EA69_8C29_4F9A_96ED_EF2EDD23F22A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d29877b1c4c19cae01df93d9d9a5bf03c857b62106f44616a2248acbda621cf
#. default-sha256: 1fd8cf1a673a855a2e8578d232ae9c042f6c5cf967078bed62c61b5f2fc2bd65
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D560EA69_8C29_4F9A_96ED_EF2EDD23F22A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You could be second to only God, yet you spurn His gift."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você poderia ser o segundo depois de Deus, mas você rejeita o presente Dele."

#: scenario7:scenario7_47F1DACD_3876_4775_99A0_E5423BACC6D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4f3b980837e76e38004e6c04c2d4092e7dbad93bdf9b2fb540f2658ffd33ac6
