#: scenario7:scenario7_180E9105_D7F5_4671_98F6_65D3AADBD25C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1dd40dec37c9e44e4e0ea605c4ecd977b4d2c1659c3657a9d3536518489ccdea
